      "id": "migration-bool-notnull",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "lib/Migration/Version1000Date20261105000000.php:67 lr_training_types.counts_hours, in Nextcloud 29 to 32",
        "lib/Migration/Version1000Date20261105000000.php:68 lr_training_types.required, in Nextcloud 29 to 32",
        "lib/Migration/Version1000Date20261105000000.php:69 lr_training_types.required_for_event, in Nextcloud 29 to 32",
        "lib/Migration/Version1000Date20261105000000.php:71 lr_training_types.active, in Nextcloud 29 to 32",
        "lib/Migration/Version1000Date20261105000000.php:131 lr_accounts.active, in Nextcloud 29 to 32",
        "lib/Migration/Version1000Date20261105000000.php:213 lr_events.sync_pending, in Nextcloud 29 to 32",
        "lib/Migration/Version1000Date20261118000000.php:28 lr_documents.required, in Nextcloud 29 to 32"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "7 boolean columns are NotNull. Oracle cannot store false in such a column, so the server stops the migration with an exception. A boolean column needs notnull false.",
        "  Up to Nextcloud 32 the server checks this only where info.xml lists no database, or lists oci among them. From Nextcloud 33 on the server makes the column nullable on Oracle itself.",
        "  lib/Migration/Version1000Date20261105000000.php:67 lr_training_types.counts_hours, in Nextcloud 29 to 32",
        "  lib/Migration/Version1000Date20261105000000.php:68 lr_training_types.required, in Nextcloud 29 to 32",
        "  lib/Migration/Version1000Date20261105000000.php:69 lr_training_types.required_for_event, in Nextcloud 29 to 32",
        "  lib/Migration/Version1000Date20261105000000.php:71 lr_training_types.active, in Nextcloud 29 to 32",
        "  lib/Migration/Version1000Date20261105000000.php:131 lr_accounts.active, in Nextcloud 29 to 32",
        "  lib/Migration/Version1000Date20261105000000.php:213 lr_events.sync_pending, in Nextcloud 29 to 32",
        "  lib/Migration/Version1000Date20261118000000.php:28 lr_documents.required, in Nextcloud 29 to 32"
      ],
